---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
// Azure DevOps 2018, three options the team weighed. Facts from the post text.
---
<figure class="rf">
  <div class="rf-scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 392" role="img" aria-label="South Central US lost power during a storm on 4 September 2018. The paired region North Central US is about 70 ms away. Three options: fail over to lagging backups and lose data, replicate synchronously across regions and pay latency or lose availability, or use synchronous availability zones inside a region with asynchronous copies across regions, which was the plan.">
    <rect x="30" y="16" width="300" height="100" rx="4" class="box bad" />
    <DiagramIcon name="cloud" x={64} y={56} size={34} />
    <DiagramIcon name="warning" x={296} y={16} size={26} />
    <text x="96" y="50" class="t-h"><tspan data-lang-en>South Central US</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>South Central US</tspan></text>
    <text x="96" y="70" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>storm and power loss,</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>bão và mất điện,</tspan></text>
    <text x="96" y="88" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>4 September 2018</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>ngày 4/9/2018</tspan></text>
    <rect x="570" y="16" width="300" height="100" rx="4" class="box" />
    <DiagramIcon name="cloud" x={604} y={56} size={34} />
    <text x="636" y="50" class="t-h"><tspan data-lang-en>North Central US</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>North Central US</tspan></text>
    <text x="636" y="70" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>the paired region,</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>region cặp đôi,</tspan></text>
    <text x="636" y="88" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>where the backups live</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>nơi chứa backup</tspan></text>
    <line x1="344.0" y1="66.0" x2="556.0" y2="66.0" class="edge dash" /><polygon points="565.0,66.0 556.0,61.5 556.0,70.5" class="head dash" /><polygon points="335.0,66.0 344.0,70.5 344.0,61.5" class="head dash" />
    <text x="450" y="52" text-anchor="middle" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>about 70 ms per round trip</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>khoảng 70 ms mỗi vòng đi về</tspan></text>
    <rect x="10" y="150" width="280" height="224" rx="4" class="box" />
    <DiagramIcon name="backup" x={46} y={190} size={34} />
    <text x="24" y="238" class="t-hs"><tspan data-lang-en>Fail over to the backups</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Failover sang backup</tspan></text>
    <text x="24" y="264" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>The data exists in region two,</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Dữ liệu có ở region thứ hai,</tspan></text>
    <text x="24" y="283" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>but the backups lag behind.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>nhưng backup bị trễ.</tspan></text>
    <text x="24" y="356" class="t-bad"><tspan data-lang-en>Would lose data</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Sẽ mất dữ liệu</tspan></text>
    <rect x="310" y="150" width="280" height="224" rx="4" class="box" />
    <DiagramIcon name="network" x={346} y={190} size={34} />
    <text x="324" y="238" class="t-hs"><tspan data-lang-en>Synchronous across regions</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Đồng bộ giữa các region</tspan></text>
    <text x="324" y="264" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>Every write waits about 70 ms</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Mỗi lần ghi chờ khoảng 70 ms</tspan></text>
    <text x="324" y="283" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>and depends on two regions.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>và phụ thuộc hai region.</tspan></text>
    <text x="324" y="356" class="t-bad"><tspan data-lang-en>Too slow, or it halts</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Quá chậm, hoặc bị dừng</tspan></text>
    <rect x="610" y="150" width="280" height="224" rx="4" class="box ok" />
    <DiagramIcon name="sync" x={646} y={190} size={34} />
    <text x="624" y="238" class="t-hs"><tspan data-lang-en>Zones sync, regions async</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Zone đồng bộ, region thì không</tspan></text>
    <text x="624" y="264" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>Zones in one region are close</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Các zone trong một region đủ</tspan></text>
    <text x="624" y="283" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>enough for synchronous copies.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>gần để sao chép đồng bộ.</tspan></text>
    <text x="624" y="302" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>Across regions: asynchronous.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Giữa các region: bất đồng bộ.</tspan></text>
    <text x="624" y="356" class="t-ok"><tspan data-lang-en>Their plan</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Kế hoạch của họ</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Source: the Azure DevOps postmortem for 4 September 2018. Every option trades something: data, speed, or availability. Only the last one was the plan.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Nguồn: postmortem của Azure DevOps cho ngày 4/9/2018. Mỗi lựa chọn đều phải đánh đổi: dữ liệu, tốc độ hoặc tính sẵn sàng. Chỉ lựa chọn cuối cùng là kế hoạch của họ.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .rf { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .rf-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .rf svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .rf text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .rf .t-h { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .rf .t-hs { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .rf .t-b { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .rf .t-note { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .rf .t-mono { font-size: 12px; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace; fill: var(--text); }
  .rf .t-bad { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; }
  .rf .t-ok { fill: var(--text); font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; }
  .rf .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .rf .box.strong { stroke: var(--text); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .rf .box.bad { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .rf .box.ok { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .rf .box.empty { fill: none; stroke-dasharray: 4 3; }
  .rf .box.bad.empty { fill: none; }
  .rf .edge { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; fill: none; }
  .rf .edge.dash { stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .rf .edge.bad { stroke: var(--red); stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .rf .edge.ok { stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .rf .head { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .rf .head.bad { fill: var(--red); }
  .rf .head.ok { fill: var(--gold-icon); }
  .rf figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
